# FLOQR package versions

Format: `{channel}{major}.{minor}.{patch}` — example `s3.0.0`.

Cache-bust interactive pages with `?v=s3.0.0`. **Never** add `?v=` (or `?screen=`) to Xibo Display URLs (`display.html?location=` / `display2.html?location=`).

## Channels

| Prefix | Name | When to use |
|---|---|---|
| **s** | **Stable** | Production-ready major line. Current line is **s3**. |
| **r** | Standard release | Optional label for a minor inside the stable line (`s3.1.0` is enough; do not invent a second number). |
| **h** | Hotfix | Emergency patch on the current stable (`s3.0.1`). |
| **d** | Development | Workspace-only experiments. Do not publish Pages as `d*`. |

Retired: `v29.09.N`. Treat those strings as historical cache keys only.

## What to bump

- **Major (`s3` → `s4`)** — breaking public API / DTO, named “major release”, or a new stable product line.
- **Minor (`s3.1.0`)** — new user-visible feature that stays compatible.
- **Patch (`s3.0.1`)** — fix, copy, help, diagnostics, CSS.

This workspace’s current stable is **s3.1.33**.

## Checklist

- [ ] `?v=` on patron/admin/help scripts matches the package
- [ ] Display Xibo URLs stay location-only
- [ ] Generated in-app links (Venue Links, FloqAi, Inbox landings) use `FLOQRNav.appVersion` — never a hardcoded `29.09.N` and never the current page's `?v=` (old bookmarks would keep minting old URLs)
- [ ] Functions `package.json` / preview-email `package` use the same id
- [ ] `floqr-nav.js` `APP_V` (= `FLOQRNav.appVersion`) equals `s` + `functions/package.json` version and README CURRENT PACKAGE, and every page's `floqr-nav.js?v=` matches — enforced by `functions/app-version-sync.test.js`; copy `scripts/bump-s3-1-33.js` (anchored, idempotent, takes a repo root so it runs on main's own copies) for the next bump
- [ ] README “CURRENT PACKAGE” line updated when publishing
